Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 6th grade: the Market Stall (unit 3, rates and
 percentages)

Price Tags (unit rates, rate problems, comparing deals and speeds),
Percent Signs (percents on a hundred grid and from fraction bars), Sale
Signs (percents, decimals, and fractions; benchmark percents; equivalent
expressions), and Discount Bin (percents on a double number line,
finding the part, percent, or whole, and word problems). 11 Khan skills,
9 new mix-ups, money answers exact to the cent, and double number lines
that fit a phone. Opens after the Bakery Unit Test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
