+          numStep(`${names[1][1]}'s speed`, 'compute', `${d[1]} ÷ ${t[1]} = ? meters per second`, s[1], {fact:fx(t[1], s[1], true), mis:v => near(v, t[1] / d[1]) ? 'rateUpsideDown' : null}),
