+    if (lvl === 2) return {title:'Percent Signs', ctx:`${n} of 100, not shaded`, bubble:`Of 100 ${what} in the crate, ${n} are ripe. What percent are ripe? What percent are not ripe?`, helper:'The whole crate is 100%.',
